CommitDate: Wed Aug 7 23:28:08 2024 +0000

    Bug 1911752 - Update WebExtension schema files to improve documentation. r=aleca

    The schema should be explicit about enum strings in the menus API to
    improve validation results. Schema files should also be more explicit
    about the expected content of email header strings.

    This patch also removes a wrong information from the mailTabs API (there
    is no `selectedMessage` property).

    Furthermore, the different implementations for the space buttons for
    Manifest V2 and Manifest V3 in the spaces API have been renamed. The
    names were originally chosen as a reminder to find a different solution
    (have a common type with individual changes in the type definition), but
    that turned out impossible. Since these names look strange in the
    documentation, we now call the type `ButtonProperties` in Manifest V2
    and `SpaceButtonProperties` in Manifest V3. This change as no effect on
    add-ons code.

    Differential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D218622

